     ..  --------------------------
 
+Unreleased
+----------
+
+- Feature: the new :ref:`[run] timestamps <config_run_timestamps>` setting
+  records when each line and branch is first executed.  The times are available
+  from the new :meth:`.CoverageData.line_timestamps` and
+  :meth:`.CoverageData.arc_timestamps` methods, and are included in the JSON
+  report.  Closes `issue 2037`_.
+
+.. _issue 2037: https://github.com/coveragepy/coveragepy/issues/2037
+
+
